### get menu by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/menus/1

### update menu by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/menus/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoidXNlcl9pZCIsIm5hbWUiOiJuYW1lIiwidXNlcm5hbWUiOiJ1c2VyIiwiZW1haWwiOiJlbWFpbCIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc2Mzk4MTU4NiwiZXhwIjoxNzY0MDY3OTg2fQ.VKyQPr-r08BfeT-vEU5_dumBhyZUu0RfY3Na5smUgWA

